---
manual: rules.negative_width
lines: [337, 339]
testability: visual
display: native
----------- app code
Shoes.app width: 500 do
  flow do
    @one = stack width: 200 do
      para "is 200 pixels wide"
    end
    @two = stack width: -200 do
      para "is 100% minus 200 pixels wide"
    end
  end
end
----------- test code
assert_in_delta 300, layout_of(stack("@two")).w, 0.5, "width: -200 lays out at the parent's width minus 200 pixels"
